---
title: Search and filter the mentor directory
date: 2026-09-13
summary: The mentor directory now has a search box, a seniority filter, and a "no reviews yet" toggle alongside company, topic and language.
type: changelog
tags:
  - mentorship
  - filters
draft: false
---

[Talk to someone who works there](/mentors) got three new ways to narrow the list.

Know roughly who you're looking for? Type a name or headline into the new **Search**
box. Want someone at your own level, or a step ahead? Pick a **Seniority** — junior
through C-level — and mentors who haven't set one simply won't match, rather than
showing up as a false positive.

There's also a **No reviews yet** toggle, for anyone who'd rather book time with a
newer mentor than wait behind a long queue for a popular one.

All three sit next to the existing company, topic and language filters, and can be
combined with them the same way.
